{"decision":"D466","name":"a-frame-prints-the-trace-of-an-error-it-holds-on-its-one-line","query":"[1 \"x\" 3] | map ~(mul 2) !| get /nope !| trace | print","expect":"\"::trace[::frame[::number/mul/SubjectNotNumberError!{:subject/expected #[::number] :subject/found \\\"x\\\" :trace ::trace[::frame[\\\"x\\\" ~(mul 2)] ::frame[[1 \\\"x\\\" 3] ~(map ~(mul 2)) /1]]} ~(get /nope)]]\""}
